{"id":"620093","name":"芥菜豆腐馅饼","author":"清水淡竹","authorId":"8451954","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/620093/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"香芥菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"豆腐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"虾皮","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜泥","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"芥菜清洗干净。","img":"images/620093/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"沸水下锅焯软，捞出过凉。","img":"images/620093/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"挤干水分切细。","img":"images/620093/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"豆腐用刀碾碎。","img":"images/620093/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"芥菜、豆腐、虾皮、蒜泥放在大碗中，加盐、蚝油。","img":"images/620093/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"拌匀成馅。","img":"images/620093/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"面粉加水、盐揉成偏软的面团，盖湿布饧发半个小时以上。","img":"images/620093/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"分成小剂子。","img":"images/620093/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"擀成中间厚、四周薄的圆片。","img":"images/620093/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入适量馅料。","img":"images/620093/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"收好口，收口朝下。","img":"images/620093/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"压扁。","img":"images/620093/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"平底锅放油烧热，放入馅饼煎制。","img":"images/620093/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"翻面再煎，两面多翻几次至熟。","img":"images/620093/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"皮薄馅足，素馅饼也很香。","img":"images/620093/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}